# Orbiting Satellites — Reverse-Engineer Reference Animation in Revideo

> The agent must watch `reference.mp4` (a 15-second animation of 6 colored circles orbiting a central circle through 3 orbital phases) and write a Revideo scene in TypeScript (`src/project.tsx`) that algorithmically reproduces it. The core challenge is reverse-engineering orbital radii, speeds, phase transitions, and direction changes from visual inspection alone.

---

## Task Configuration

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Difficulty | Hard |
| Category | Animation |
| Agent Timeout | 2 hours |
| Verifier Timeout | 20 minutes |
| Internet Access | Enabled (waivered — required for Puppeteer loopback) |
| CPUs / Memory | 8 CPUs / 32 GB |

